>>
Rule 1 (A must have at least 2 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 2 (A must have floating or complex dtype: float32/float64/complex64/complex128)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 7 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 3 (A must be batches of square matrices: last two dims equal)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2)
>>
Rule 4 (out tensor, if provided, must have the same dtype as A)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 5 (out tensor, if provided, must have the same shape as A)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 6 (Low-precision Half (float16) is not supported for A)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 6
